{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":282108,\"title\":\"Rocky Mountain Wreckers\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"When winter slams into the highways of the American Rockies, heavy recovery specialists from four companies race into action, working to clear wrecks and open roads. Whether it's a raging fire or toxic spill, crews roll up ready to battle the wreckage. They've got the equipment and the skills. But with more than a million people depending on the route that crosses these three states every day, the one thing they don't have, is time.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zQ07TNjbLFH7xr4xfmFRJsKAhlx.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lYKGkUDwyXi8g1gpuzMbzKr8Y5h.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":5.5,\"voteCount\":2,\"year\":2025,\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"status\":\"Returning Series\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":2,\"totalEpisodes\":16,\"createdBy\":[],\"networks\":[\"USA Network\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2026-10-30\",\"cast\":[],\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"NcK7xCqLUAs\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"YWsehKKeY5A\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"2xGT6cGP-G8\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":285427,\"title\":\"Stadium Lockup\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nxeChs62ZQKNySzrCwDnbHU00fg.jpg\",\"rating\":9.5,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.42658227848101266,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":72926,\"title\":\"Feuer & Flamme\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kURevdhdZoZOjtM47uKKoeKvhqs.jpg\",\"rating\":9.4,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.42500000000000004,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":281502,\"title\":\"Feuerwache 4 - Alarm in Stuttgart\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/AlZSXWLa8xMeREeZ413HiDl246N.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4206896551724138,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":320197,\"title\":\"1000 Grad: Feuerwehr hautnah\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/z0GKZbIRJozuVCXIhIKBzVZQ2KV.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4206896551724138,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":67946,\"title\":\"Ambulance\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lDCMZPoPaMeNnHfqBjLyI05i9ug.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4194805194805195,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":63798,\"title\":\"Chaos Caught on Camera\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wxL0P1M4BfQ3EyLDVkN3LzG6Ih4.jpg\",\"rating\":1,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.41923076923076924,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":282124,\"title\":\"The Sea Rescuers\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9vgOXf1Fem8JUoGg0aJIBSsHPCh.jpg\",\"rating\":9,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.41704545454545455,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":303059,\"title\":\"The Lifesavers of Murnau\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eCSQfcSG9aJ4B7DO3UKFLpsxl3Y.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.41463414634146345,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":69507,\"title\":\"Everest Rescue\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/w4dELbaXgcAzy6dMIujV0oesv0J.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.41263157894736846,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":97562,\"title\":\"Baby Chimp Rescue\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qMksednHxM2gJbAY7YnJOTnyb99.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4123287671232877,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":109000,\"title\":\"Izzy's Koala World\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6rsZXpoLkZ64nfXJ2py6ZksRUwc.jpg\",\"rating\":9,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.41200000000000003,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":250451,\"title\":\"Rescue Helsinki\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vuP524rEdvQGwAFVne9rRWGgjIK.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.41058823529411764,\"_genreOverlap\":1}],\"seasonNumber\":2,\"seasonName\":\"Season 2\",\"seasonOverview\":\"\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zQ07TNjbLFH7xr4xfmFRJsKAhlx.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2026-10-09\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Living Life on the Edge\",\"overview\":\"A damaged hauler carrying U.S. mail through Colorado shuts down I-70. Hurricane-force winds in Wyoming leave a semi skewered. A jackknife on an icy overpass in Utah has the recovery crew at odds.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dWeOwsU8dGwhBga4Z63EB6ju4ik.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-10-09\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"The Tunnel of Chaos\",\"overview\":\"The I-70 Eisenhower Tunnel closes in both directions as a 78-vehicle pileup creates mass chaos. Mountain Recovery and Stauffer's Towing battle high winds and slick roads to clear wreckage and keep major highways moving.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3AJt6YlAu0bPckS3kfdVzJx2Mcj.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-10-16\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Avalanche Country\",\"overview\":\"Competing companies team up to recover a fully loaded cement truck leaking natural gas. Big Jon heads into avalanche country to rescue a stuck semi carrying hazardous goods. During a sudden blizzard, a crash in Salt Lake City leaves a semi in pieces.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/i3Pf2I6QW6pLq9jH5eNiUkZyjLo.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-10-23\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Disaster in Denver\",\"overview\":\"Mountain Recovery faces a tight deadline to recover a semi in a Denver water reservoir; high winds roll over a hauler carrying groceries through Wyoming; a heavy operator heads into a dangerous storm in the Colorado mountains to bring drivers to safety.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fZBLPZp7PfxhikVVDVa4bL8HG7A.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-10-30\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Ain't Worth Dying For\",\"overview\":\"As a record-breaking windstorm hits Wyoming, recovery crews work side by side in hurricane-force winds to right rolled semis and clear the interstate. An icy path around Utah Lake overturns a loaded dump truck.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/icHymZ2QXjcZD0vxjfh2jj4SPWV.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-11-06\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"The Midnight Storm\",\"overview\":\"Big Al's Towing races the clock as a semi carrying an expensive frozen load overturns on I-80. Stauffer's Towing faces a marathon rescue mission for a propane truck on a steep mountain road. Mountain Recovery clears a hauler blocking mountain traffic.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uRW1ivcEUGEMlVn4tJbNmunayfo.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-11-13\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Spinning Out on I-80\",\"overview\":\"A windstorm near Salt Lake City overturns a semi with a mystery load. A hauler with a heavy-duty load of data center cooling units spins out of control on I-80. Mountain Recovery's rookie operator fights a multi-front battle as a midwinter storm hits.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-11-20\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"The 300-Foot Drop\",\"overview\":\"A once-in-a-lifetime recovery of a mangled truck 300 feet down the sheer drop of the San Juan mountains puts Mountain Recovery on edge. A windstorm rollover in Wyoming sends a semi into the cable barrier with recovery crews caught in interstate traffic.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-11-27\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"I Don't Want to Die Today\",\"overview\":\"A semi goes up in flames, causing a messy cleanup in UT as trailer remains explode across I-80. Meanwhile, an operator goes on a solo mission to tow a stuck semi home. High winds flip a tractor-trailer 180 degrees in WY, forcing crews to work backwards.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-12-04\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"100,000 Pounds of Trouble\",\"overview\":\"\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-12-11\",\"runtime\":44}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2025-01-14\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}